## Groth16 verifier template  (MIT)

The generated Solidity verifiers in `last_build/*.sol` are emitted from gnark's Groth16 verifier
template and carry an `SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT` header crediting the template author
(Remco Bloemen). That header is retained in each generated file.

